---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0E1322] to-[#0B0F19]">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-14 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900/40 via-blue-950/60 to-indigo-950/40 border border-blue-500/30 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Glow background -->
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Primer Paso Sin Compromiso
      </span>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Dejá de perder horas en planillas y tareas manuales.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Vamos a tu depósito o empresa durante 2 horas, detectamos dónde se escapa el tiempo de tu equipo y te mostramos cómo solucionarlo con una herramienta a tu medida.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.contactWhatsApp}?text=Hola!%20Queremos%20coordinar%20una%20visita%20de%20diagn%C3%B3stico%20gratuita%20en%20nuestra%20empresa%20de%20log%C3%ADstica.`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white shadow-xl shadow-emerald-600/30 transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86.173.086.275.073.376-.044.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.144.39-.086s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.045.072.045.419-.099.824zm-3.392-12.416c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 2.123.553 4.116 1.518 5.852l-1.618 5.91 6.071-1.593c1.674.912 3.593 1.431 5.629 1.431 6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12s-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Escribinos al WhatsApp Directo</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}?subject=Consulta%20por%20diagnostico%20operativo`}
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl bg-gray-900/80 hover:bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 border border-gray-700 transition-colors"
        >
          <span>O mandanos un email</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 text-xs text-gray-400">
        Respuesta rápida garantizada en menos de 2 horas hábiles.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
